"No. The pod handles processing, reconciliations and preparation while your accountant or finance director keeps oversight, approvals and advisory decisions. All schedules are prepared in their preferred format, so year-end work gets easier rather than more complicated."},{"question":"Are permissions and payments properly controlled?","answer":"Your team approves all payment runs and bank movements. Pod access is scoped by role, sensitive actions require your authorisation, and every journal carries a traceable record of who prepared and reviewed it."},{"question":"How is finance support priced?","answer":"Pods are billed as a fixed monthly retainer per dedicated finance specialist, not per transaction or per invoice. Scope is agreed up front and reviewed quarterly as volumes and entity structures change."},{"question":"Can you support multiple currencies and entities?","answer":"Yes. We routinely handle multi-currency ledgers, intercompany allocations and consolidated reporting across UK, US and EU entities. Any complexity is mapped during the finance review before the pod goes live."},{"question":"What if we need more capacity at year-end?","answer":"Peaks are planned into the reporting calendar, and extra capacity can be added with two to three weeks' notice. Year-end support blocks are often agreed at the start of the engagement so deadlines never become bottlenecks."}]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"w-full py-space-3xl bg-surface","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin lg:px-margin-desktop space-y-space-2xl","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-space-md","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-space-xs max-w-xl","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-emerald-accent tracking-widest uppercase font-bold","children":"KEEP EXPLORING"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-xl text-headline-